This Writ Petition under Article 226 of the Constitution of India is filed seeking for the following reliefs:
"i) Issue a writ of certiorari to quash the impugned endorsement dated 06-06-2023 issued by the 3rd respondent bearing No.J.J.P:J/Dg-13/2023- 24/170,168,166 as at Annexure-O;
ii) Issue a writ of mandamus directing the respondent no.3 to consider the application preferred by the petitioners invoking Sec.28(A) of Land Acquisition Act,
1894 dated 20-11-2006 as at Annexure C,C1 and C2 within such stipulated time as this Court deems fit, in the circumstances of the case;
Revamma Died By Lrs A) Subhash And Ors vs The State Of Karnataka And Ors on 25 March, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/81778234/
3 iii) To issue a writ of mandamus directing the respondent 1 and 2 to hold necessary enquiry in the NC: 2026:KHC-K:2712 HC-KAR matter for passing impugned order and for swearing a wrong affidavit contrary to the records;
iv) Pass any such order's as this court deems fit in the circumstances of the case."
2. Heard the learned counsel for the parties.
